arded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December and the high number of awardees do not prove improper actions. These could reflect market conditions or budget constraints, not wrongdoing.\nWhat can be checked: Check the December contracts for consistency with other contracts and verify if multiple contracts served the same purpose. Review awardee A's contracts to ensure no patterns of repeated purchases for the same need.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["RcEjF66vG0Q3vLk2DU2Ddg%3D%3D","V2hPIlqxpQ1SYrkJkLlFdw%3D%3D","fPwkdCAeAKCdkQsA7ROvsg%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}